window.products.push({"id":452142,"name":"GTRACING Gaming Chair,Ergonomic Racing Desk Chair with Adjustable High-Back,Professional Chair with Headrest and Lumbar Pillow GTBEE Series (Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TLTPnXz1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Perfect Companion】: Exquisite stitches,embroidered logos and the curve which fits the human body highlight its charm everywhere. When you end a game heartily and finally win,the happiness belongs to you and your companion-a professional GTRACING gaming chair that has always supported you.Height:48.82”-51.92”.Diameter:27.56”.Weight Capacity:300lbs. 【Most Comfortable And Relaxing】: Equipped with headrest and lumbar pillow system.When you feel tired from sitting intently for a long time,please lean back at will.The chair can be placed flat to 170°,instead of the usual 135° or 150°. Lie on a chair almost parallel to the ground,under the support of the foam-filled cloud-like soft headrest and lumbar pillow,put on the music,wear eyeshade and start enjoying time! 【Liberate Your Arms】: Do you lie back after concentrating on work or play? Your body will be supported by the main body of the chair,then where should your arms be placed? Hanging in the air?Obviously inappropriate,so this height-adjustable armrests can meet your needs.You can adjust it to a suitable position through the button on the back.It looks hard, but it’s actually filled with soft materials, so don’t worry about your arms being forced on resting on the hard shelf. 【Reject Short-Lived Chairs】: We never hesitate to apply materials to make customers satisfied.The built-in metal frame must be wider,and the foam under the leather must be rich,it can’t collapse as if we are sitting on a hard stone when leaning up.The chair has gone through thousands of rotation and sitting experiments before mass production.Sufficient and premium materials can ensure the chair to withstand long-term use. 【Worry-Free Purchase】: A detailed instruction will be sent to you along with all accessories so that you can assemble the chair easily.Free replacement or refund within 30 days.Free replacement or repair within 1 year.If you have any questions or suggestions,please feel free to contact us,we will do our best to make our customers satisfied.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TLTPnXz1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GTRACING","source_asin":"B07DNVG8HC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-452142","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DNVG8HC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DNVG8HC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":452143,"name":"ARTBECK Star Curtains Kids Curtains for Girls Bedroom Living Room Mermaid Ombre Blackout Curtain Double Layer Tulle Star Cut Out Gradient Grommet Wind","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71k+6hmQyHS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hollow Star - Elegant double-layer star cutout blackout curtain, the whole panel is a mermaid gradient color, beautiful and generous. With the hollowed-out stars accurately cut by useful laser technology, when the light passes, the room will show the whole twinkling star sky, the dreamlike rainbow color, especially suitable for the girl's bedroom. The colorful curtains flutter with the wind, adding romantic, warm and lovely feeling to the girl's room Double Layer Design - Beautiful kids star blackout curtain using high-quality shading cloth and interesting White Tulle collocation, highlighting the hazy and fashionable design aesthetic feeling. The side of the hollowed-out star cutout curtains is fan-shaped, with beautiful tulle and elegant lace. The morning lights through the hollowed-out stars, through the gauze, less light on your sleepy eyes, bring you a good mood, perfect decoration for your room Home Decoration: Beautiful and elegant girls curtain. Add wonderful color and fashionable design to your living space. The curtain adopts unique fine knitting technology, which has good shading performance. It can block 85%-95% of the light. Suitable for kids, girls boys bedroom, living room, bedroom, study, etc Packaging - 1-panel star curtains in per package. Each curtain panel has 6~8 Nano grommets on top. The nano-ring is quieter when it is pulled. Each grommet inner diameter is 1.6 inch, comparable with most rods. Easy to hang, and slide smoothly Easy Care - The star curtain can be machine washed in cold water. Gently cycle. Wash with mild detergent. It can be dried if necessary. Dry in a well ventilated place. Don't bleach. Pure and bright color, not easy to fade","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71k+6hmQyHS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ARTBECK","source_asin":"B08FLCMRK8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-452143","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FLCMRK8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FLCMRK8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
