window.products.push({"id":452190,"name":"Jack 4 Piece Calendar Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1xa4PHr50L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"From the Manufacturer Wall Pops are an interactive Wall Art system. You choose from a huge selection of colorful and trendy design options that will literally transform any room from ordinary to fabulous in only minutes! Then, just peel and stick to create your own unique work of art, your signature statement! Wall Pops are completely repositionable, so if you change your mind, you can change your entire design. And because they are not permanent, they come off as easily as they go on without harming walls or leaving sticky adhesive residue. Perfect for dorms or apartments where personal decoration is often restricted. These new, dry erase calendars and memos add additional function to wall fashion. Wall Pops are fast, fashionable, and functional but mostly they are fun!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1xa4PHr50L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wall Pops","source_asin":"B005GJI7Z0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-452190","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005GJI7Z0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005GJI7Z0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":452191,"name":"20 Pack Fairy Lights Battery Operated 3.3ft 20 LED Mini String Lights Twinkle Lights Copper Wire Firefly Starry Lights for Mason Jars Wedding Party Ch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kQFZ22l4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Newly Upgraded 3.3ft 20 LEDs Fairy lights: Our fairy lights battery operated consist 3.3 ft flexible copper wire and 20 super bright LEDs. As per market research, more customers prefer shorter wire length, so we kept the number of 20 LED lights but shorten the wire length to 3.3 ft, which makes it easier to DIY any shape you like without having to wrap many circles Long Life Battery and Continuous Illumination: The twinkle lights are pre-installed with long-life batteries that provide long endurance lighting for more than 72 hours. The high-quality batteries allow the fairy lamp to continuously emit warm light, making our daily life as wonderful as a fairy tale. Durable Material and Safe To Touch: We insist on using high-quality materials for each of our mini string lights, since providing high-quality products to customers is the principle of our brand. Our copper wire mini lights using high quality 3V low voltage insulated line, which makes it cool to touch and safe to use, the soft LED lights will not harm children’s eyes. Wide and Diverse Applicated Scenarios: Our LED fairy lights by battery operated can be used indoor and outdoor since the string lights are waterproof (Note: the battery case is not waterproof). The portable mini lights can be taken to anywhere you want to decorate. Moreover, our battery case is extremely mini in size(2*0.87 in), which makes it super easy to hide anywhere. Romantic Your Moments and Brighten Your Life: Our 20 pack fairy lights is perfect for decorations and creating romantic atmosphere on Valentine's Day, Christmas, Halloween, and any other important festivals. So just follow your heart to DIY your life, wherever bedroom, patio, table settings, parties, Wedding, mason jars. Hope our fairy lights surrounds all your important moments.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kQFZ22l4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOBAYS","source_asin":"B0C5754X6C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-452191","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5754X6C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5754X6C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":452192,"name":"American Ayurveda 100% Pure Copper Water Bottle 600ml 20 Oz Joint Free, Leak Proof, Tumbler, Flask, Yoga, Health Benefits, Natural Ayurvedic Alkaline ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71o-rVZLJpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Made from pure copper. Jointless Construction, Screw on cap for a leak proof seal. Please make sure that you are buying from American Ayurveda and not from any other merchant. Make sure you have the \"American Ayurveda\" logo on the cap of the bottle. Immediately return the bottle to the sender if the bottle cap does not have \"American Ayurveda\" logo. No compromise on Purity of copper or the make. We are sure about the purity of our copper because we lab test every batch of copper before we make our products. Better than any plastic, Aluminum or Stainless Steel bottles for everyday use. Have many health benefits according to the ancient Ayurvedic text Carry the water in this bottle to Gym, work, while traveling or anywhere you go. The water in the bottle remains cooler than the ambient temperature naturally. Please expect a ding or two on the bottle due to the long distance shipping. Cleaning the bottle is a breeze. Wash with regular dish washing soap and water daily before refilling. When copper turns dark “Bar Keeper’s Friend” Liquid works great in restoring original copper with very little effort. All genuine copper bottles come with the USPTO registered logo of American Ayurveda which is the assurance of quality.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71o-rVZLJpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"American Ayurveda","source_asin":"B0867QMV81","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-452192","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0867QMV81","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0867QMV81","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":452193,"name":"FUNWHOLE Medieval-Pier-Inn Lighting Building Bricks Set - Medieval Pier Inn LED Light Construction Building Model Set 2143 Pcs for Adults and Teen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810awRfl7rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Innovative Lighting Design: FO had custom-made 13 sets of light strings for this set, which will illuminate a total of 21 light sources. As night falls, the lights on the mast illuminate the roof, the warm yellow oil lamps hanging on the ridge, and the flames of the grill are burning. The pub gradually becomes lively, and the warm light spills out of the windows, reflecting on the sea surface. Exclusive Design Inspiration: The Pier Inn by the seaside was transformed from an old sailing ship, allowing you to escape the hustle and bustle of modern life and transport yourself back to a peaceful medieval village. The building is meticulously designed to replicate the architectural features and daily life of the medieval era. Extremely Distinctive Building: This tavern, transformed from an old sailing vessel, retains elements like the hull, masts, and sails. The multi-story structure features easy-to-disassemble roofs and main structures, with the roofs able to be propped up by masts and three walls that can rotate and open up. It also comes with four minifigures representing different characters. Exquisite Interior Details: The first floor is the tavern hall, with food and utensils, among other things. The basement is connected to the sea and used for storing kegs and various items. Half of the first floor is reserved for guests to chat and play cards. One side of the second floor is the brewhouse, while the other side is the owner's private space. Quality Guarantee:The building bricks and lighting accessories have undergone strict quality inspections to ensure that every brick fits snugly together. We also provide a 2-year warranty for free. If you have any difficulties, feel free to send us an email for help.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810awRfl7rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FUNWHOLE","source_asin":"B0BLHDN3ZB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-452193","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLHDN3ZB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLHDN3ZB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
