window.products.push({"id":452335,"name":"Plastic Kitchen Knife Set of 3 in 3 colors for Kids with Flexible Plastic Cutting Board Mats set of 4 Colors. Safe Nylon Cooking Knives and Cutting Bo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K6IvMUG9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Real Cooking Tools For Kids This Nylon knife Set has serrated cutting edges which are safe to use, blunt tips and ergonomic handles making them easy for young children to safely use. This Plastic Knife set includes 1 large 11.42\" X 2.24\"(29cm X 5.7cm), 1 medium 9.45\" X 1.85\" (24cm x 4.7cm) and 1 small 7.09\" X 1.46\"(18cm X 3.7cm). The flexible Plastic Cutting Board set will help kids learn about safe food handling and preparation.They include 4 colors in red blue green and yellow and measure 9 X 6 inches. Real Cooking Tools Not Toys Neylon Knives are excellent for preparing lettuce, salads or vegetables for both adults and kids. Will safely cut lettuce, fruit, vegetables, cheese, cake and more. The sturdy cutting edge will easily cut through heads of lettuce and other vegetables, will slice loaves of bread, cut that big birthday cake, slice those brownies into squares, and it will even make slicing your favorite veggies and easy task. You can even use it to spread frosting on cakes & brownies! Great For Use Outdoors A Great Plastic Kitchen Knife and cutting board set for outdoor use. Plastic Kitchen Knives and cutting boards are so much safer for outdoor use such as on-the-go needs like picnics, camping, boating and RV use. Safe Cooking Tools For Children This Plastic kitchen knife set cuts most foods, but will not cut the skin. This will allow you to get the kids involved in the kitchen from an early age without fear of accidents, learn about food safety and allow them to develop essential life skills and a love of good food and cooking! Learning to cook from an early age gives children the ability to choose and cook healthier foods and as a result will enable them to enjoy and maintain a healthier lifestyle in later years.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K6IvMUG9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GarMills","source_asin":"B078HC4JQ6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-452335","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078HC4JQ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078HC4JQ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
