window.products.push({"id":452463,"name":"CUKOR Hot Plate for Candle Making,Electric Single Burner for Cooking, Portable Electric Stove, Electric Cooktop, Portable Electric Stove, Countertop b","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KT1bUUhsL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"COMPATIBLE WITH ALL COOKWARES: Works with 120V/1200W power supply. Perfect solution for frying, stir-frying, cooking soup and slow cooking, and can also be used for home-style Teppanyaki and BBQ with a barbeque plate and rack. The burner can be used with any flat-bottomed cookware made of a variety of materials. Examples are frying pans, woks or stovetop teapots made from aluminum, stainless steel, ceramic or glass. SAFETY & DURABILITY: The burner includes features such as: no radiation, no fire used, no carbon monoxide, voltage and thermal regulator for protection,no stovetop required. It fits cookware as heavy as 22 lbs. Its body is built with stainless steel for durability. Our factory has passed BSCI certification，all our products are certified by ETL. PORTABLE: Being small in size and light in weight, the compact design makes the burner consume little space, thus a perfect travel solution. Easy cleaning with wet cloth. It is an ideal choice in many places such as student dorms, offices, camping sites, RV and home. Cast-iron hot plate needs to be preheated for 10 minutes for best use, and it takes about 20 minutes for a hot plate to cool down, keeping the food warm longer. Please do not touch the burner body when in use. ECO-FRIENDLY& EFFICIENT: The burner cycles on and off to maintain the desired temperature automatically. It is equipped with thermal fuse for overheating protection.The temperature ranges from 80℉ to 1058℉.It is safe and saves 30% electricity compared with traditional induction cooker. WARRANTY: Our product comes with a 30-day return policy and an 18-month free replacement policy for your worry-free customer experience. Please contact us should you have any questions, and we will get back to you in 24 hours.Note:Please clean the burner after it cools down.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KT1bUUhsL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CUKOR","source_asin":"B0BYZ8CSW2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-452463","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYZ8CSW2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYZ8CSW2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":452464,"name":"Lane Kids Regal Grande Upholstered Swivel Glider, Chocolate","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZGzozBCFL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Lane Kids regal grande upholstered swivel glider offers the ultimate place to rest and relax in comfort and style. Boasting one of the widest and deepest seating areas in its class, the ultra-spacious regal grande will easily become a centerpiece in your home. The soothing gliding motion with metal ball bearings is the perfect way to help relax you and your baby. Made with a high-quality hardwood frame and soft, luxurious 100% microfiber cushions, the Lane Kids regal grande upholstered swivel glider is built to last and easy to care for. The regal grande has gorgeous styling and is available in multiple color fabrics that will easily coordinate with your baby's nursery decor or any other room in the home. Matching Lane Kids universal upholstered ottoman sold separately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZGzozBCFL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lane Kids","source_asin":"B00NWHE0P4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-452464","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00NWHE0P4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00NWHE0P4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":452465,"name":"Wonder Bread Sandwich Container, Colors May Vary","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RUcYk2VeL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Wonder Bread Sandwich Container is the best way to-Pack your sandwich to go. Keeps your sandwiches fresh and tasty by keeping air out and not getting squished. 5-inch square. Dishwasher safe. BPA-free.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RUcYk2VeL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Evriholder","source_asin":"B003IUDF4C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-452465","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003IUDF4C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003IUDF4C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":452466,"name":"Christmas Gift Set Limited Edition Metrokane Rabbit Wine Corkscrew Set with Houdini Aerating Pourer and Foil Cutter Kiwi Green Comes Ready in a Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ys205jNjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Metrokane Wine Rabbit Corkscrew with Houdini Aerating Pourer - Green. The Rabbit Corkscrew can pull a cork in 3 seconds flat! A Wine Accessory Set that has it all, The Rabbit Corkscrew can pull a cork in 3 seconds flat, and automatically releases the cork. The user-friendly ergonomic design opens any size wine bottle. All the gear teeth are made of hardened metal. With the Houdini Aerating Pourer, you won't need a decanter or a separate aerator, simply insert the Aerator into the wine bottle as you would a conventional pourer. When you pour the wine, you see and hear aeration happening. When you taste it, you enjoy the enhanced flavor and bouquet of perfectly aerated red wine. The Houdini Aerating Pourer is the first easy, uncomplicated way to aerate wine. It also includes the Worm just in case you'll need to replace it, Even though a corkscrew spiral, or worm, is good for up to 1,000 cork removals, it will wear out eventually. This replacement worm fits all Metrokane Rabbit and Houdini corkscrews. Made of high-tensile steel, the worm features mini-bearings in the head and is coated with a triple layer of non-stick finish, which enables it to glide in and out of the cork with ease. The lever-style mechanism of the Metrokane corkscrew pulls the cork from the bottle with equal ease. To install, unscrew the protective cap on the corkscrew, remove the old worm, insert the new one, and screw the cap back on.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ys205jNjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Metrokane","source_asin":"B019D5UMW8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-452466","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B019D5UMW8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B019D5UMW8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
