window.products.push({"id":452665,"name":"WISELIFE 3 Pack Reusable Grocery Bags Large Shopping Bags, Water Resistant Grocery Tote Bag Collapsible Heavy Duty Tote Bags for Shopping Picnic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oAMCcgqGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"non-woven fabric and water resistant coating Imported The multifunctional storage tote can be used as a storage box to organize toys/ books/CDs or to carry and organize laundry, cleaning supplies, art supplies, scrapbook items, and school work. Perfect way to organize clutter. The storage tote also works as a reusable grocery box to carry groceries and fits well in a shopping cart to organize while shopping. Also perfect for packing picnics and snacks and carrying supplies for the beach or camping. Organize items in car or trunk. [COLLAPSIBLE & EASY TO CLEAN] Folds up flat for easy storage when not in use. Cardboard bottom ensures that the reusable tote will not shift when in use and will remain open and upright in car. This water resistant reusable shopping bags foldable is easy to clean; simply use a wet cloth to wipe off dirt or debris and let air dry. [RIGID STRUCTURE & LARGE CAPACITY] The eco-friendly reusable grocery tote is made of heavy-duty non-woven water resistant fabric reinforced and stiffened with a durable recycled cardboard insert on each side, ensuring a rigid structure when opened. The durable rigid design makes totes easy to stack without folding or shifting in a car or trunk. The strong grocery tote can hold up to 33 lbs. Each tote measures 14” x 11” x 12\" (LxWxH),Volume: 30L. Purchase includes a set of 3 grocery totes. [EASY TO CARRY] The grocery shopping bags have short side handles in addition to longer wide shoulder straps to ensure comfortable use, even when carrying a heavy load. The shoulder straps are sewn down the side of the bag and secured with metal rivets for added strength. The thick side handle and rigid construction make it easy to pick up the tote from the car, grocery cart, or shelf for quick access. [REUSABLE & ECO FRIENDLY] Our box bags are convenient for grocery shopping. One reusable bag is equivalent to 1000+ times of using plastic disposal bags. The reusable totes are a wonderful alternative to single-use plastic bags that are not recycled,and frequently pollute waterways and other public areas. Choose a fashionable and eco-friendly way to protect our Earth. Keep folded shopping totes in your handbag and car for emergencies or outdoor activities.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oAMCcgqGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WISELIFE","source_asin":"B0969JDHHB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-452665","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0969JDHHB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0969JDHHB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
