window.products.push({"id":452704,"name":"Fengshuibringluck Magic Golden Earth Dragon Keychain Wealth Power Carrier, 9.2x5.3cm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Tm1LDU7zL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"The dragon is one of the most popular auspicious symbols. It was a symbol of the emperor in ancient times. It gave all the power to dominate everything. It has a supreme and irreplaceable status, because each part of the dragon has a special meaning: the raised forehead represents wisdom. Antlers represent the country and longevity; bull ears mean number one; tiger eyes show majesty; claws are brave; sword eyebrows symbolize bravery; lion nose symbolizes preciousness; goldfish tail symbolizes flexibility; horse teeth symbolize diligence and kindness. Gold represents wealth and supremacy. For the Chinese, dragon is always associated with leadership, courage and strength Having the image of a dragon attracts wealth and success, as well as all kinds of good luck. So put it in your bag or at home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Tm1LDU7zL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fengshuibringluck","source_asin":"B09J7YQF1P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-452704","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09J7YQF1P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09J7YQF1P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":452705,"name":"BlueHills Travel Blanket Pillow in Mini Soft Case Premium Plush Airplane Blanket in Soft Bag Compact Pack with Luggage Belt and Backpack Clip - Navy B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.34,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VGB5FzlJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ultrasoft Plush Compact Travel Blanket Airplane with patented design - Experience Absolute Bliss while traveling: Wrap yourself up in a luxurious plush, warm airplane travel blanket and enjoy maximum comfort on your journey. Enjoy a great night’s sleep wherever you might be. This is a premium soft travel blanket choice for traveling in a Car, Plane, Train, RV, or Cruise ship, or being at a Camping site, RV, Hotel, Theater, Sports stadium, Concert, Dorm, Day Care or more. Use as a Travel Pillow or Travel Blanket: Snuggle up beneath this soft airplane blanket or put it in the case and you will have a comfortable pillow to rest your head. There are beautiful color options to choose from. This beautiful navy blue travel blanket is a must have travel essential to keep you well rested on the go. Lightweight & Compact Blanket Pillow Combo: Our lightweight, super compact blanket fits easily into hand luggage and backpacks while being almost weightless and leaving plenty of empty space. This is a great small, packable travel blanket that is warm and cozy, and is a great travel accessory available in an assortment of colors. Soft Case with Hand Luggage Belt Strap & Backpack Clip- Great gift for Travelers: Quickly and easily attach this compact plane blanket pillow to your work bag, backpack, suitcase, or more for effortless transportation in places such as an airport terminal. This is also a great travel gift to give anyone. Warm Throw Blanket with carry case: Your perfect companion on movie night. Relax on the couch as you indulge in your favorite TV series with this ultra-soft portable blanket. This is a thoughtful gift for any traveler.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VGB5FzlJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BlueHills","source_asin":"B08PBCKX1B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-452705","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PBCKX1B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PBCKX1B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
