window.products.push({"id":452746,"name":"Okura Magic Home Charcoal Grey Congratulations, Anniversary or Graduation Black Individual Cupcake Boxes with Window, 25 Pack, Colorful Custom Designs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Lb01uQkDS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STYLE…make an impact and create memories when presenting your beautiful cupcake creations. Enjoy unique designs and colour. FOR EVERY OCCASION…birthday, wedding, boy or girl baby shower, anniversary, graduation, congratulation’s, kids party or even a gift for a teacher! STRONG, SAFE & SECURE…don’t worry about your cupcakes moving. Our food grade recyclable cardboard paper boxes have inserts to secure your cupcakes or sweet treats. ASSEMBLY...Quality easy pop up base assembles in seconds, just push either side – not all cupcake containers offer this feature. Instructions included. Our cupcake boxes are slightly bigger than industry standard. KEEP CLEAN… these cute and colourful boxes have been carefully designed with a thin coating on top to help you wipe off any spills.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Lb01uQkDS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OKURA MAGIC HOME","source_asin":"B08QJ8BDSY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-452746","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QJ8BDSY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QJ8BDSY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":452747,"name":"Vacu Vin WineMaster Corkscrew, Clear","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/3185T8VKZZL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description Regularly described as the world's most advanced corkscrew! The WineMaster will effortlessly uncork bottles in seconds without any twisting or pulling. Operating is simple. The WineMaster is equipped with a bottle grip that locks the corkscrew on to the bottle to leave both hands free for easy use. Moving handles with a smooth and easy action, the WineMaster both inserts the specially coated spiral and extracts the cork.A detachable foil cutter is included with every WineMaster to ensure a safe and clean removal of the foil. Made in The Netherlands by VacuVin. 10 inches h. 2 year guarantee Amazon.com It's another wonder of modern technology from the folks at Vacu Vin: this corkscrew stands head and shoulders above any similar model. The tiny foil cutter stores in the top of the machine--just pop it out, squeeze gently over the top of the foil, and the foil falls right off. Next, insert the cork into the bottom of the WineMaster, with all four handles in the upright position. The corkscrew inserts itself when you pull the two smaller handles down, and you lift the cork by pulling the two larger handles. The last step: just raise all four handles again to pull out the cork--no yanking or twisting necessary! For the occasional extra-long cork, you may need to perform the steps twice--but this corkscrew's still far easier to use than most others. You'll want to open wine just as an excuse to show off this cool gadget. Tell guests they only get to play if they bring their own bottle! --Jill Lightner","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/3185T8VKZZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vacu Vin","source_asin":"B00005AS54","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-452747","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005AS54","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005AS54","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
