window.products.push({"id":452807,"name":"Sliding Glass Door Draft Stopper | Energy-Efficient Weatherstripping for Sliding Door Pet Panels | Dog and Cat Door Compatible | Universal Fit & Easy ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kqXAidALL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Do you have a gap between your sliding glass door or window pet door insert and your home framing?The Patio Pacific Draft Stopper is a must-have for preventing drafts & energy loss. If your home is experiencing unwanted cold or heat from your doggie or kittie door, we have a weatherproof solution for you!This sliding door draft stopper is designed to eliminate drafts to keep your home temperature stable. Black or white colors are available to accommodate differing door colors.The draft stopper is easily installed using the adhesive backing while remaining easily removable. Clean the edge of your patio door with rubbing alcohol before installing. Attach the draft stopper on either the back edge of the sliding door panel or the leading edge of the stationary panel. Trim with scissors as needed.The draft stopper, which is included with all Endura Flap vertical panels and horizontal sashes, also works with any brand of panel dog or cat door for an airtight seal. It requires ½” frame space to adhere properly.The adhesive is 1/2” wide and begins inset at 1/8”. The overall width of the draft stopper is 1 7/8”. It covers gaps up to 1½” wide.Depending on your door height, 81” or 96” lengths are available. If your door is taller than 96”, purchase another 81” draft stopper and trim it for the perfect fit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kqXAidALL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Patio Pacific","source_asin":"B07MHYFNCG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-452807","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MHYFNCG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MHYFNCG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
