window.products.push({"id":452824,"name":"mDesign Metal Farmhouse Kitchen Pantry Food Storage Organizer Basket Bin - Wire Grid Design for Cabinets, Cupboards, Shelves, Countertops - Holds Pota","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HhOfYcwjL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"STORAGE MADE SIMPLE: These large-capacity bins are great for creating a clean and organized kitchen cabinet or pantry; Great for holding fruits, vegetables storing dry goods, soups, food packets, seasonings, baking supplies, snack bags, boxed foods, soda pop bottles, sports and energy drinks; Use side by side and combine with other mDesign bins to create the storage solution that works best for you; The slim format is great for cube storage shelving and furniture units; Set of 4 PORTABLE: Bins feature easy-carry integrated handles that are built right in to make it simple to transport goods from pantry to shelf to table; Just grab and go; The perfect storage and organizing solution for modern kitchens and pantries; Perfect for fruits, vegetables, pastas, soups, bottles, cans, cookies, macaroni and cheese boxes, pouches, jars, bread, baked goods and many other kitchen pantry items; Great for other kitchen items such as towels, candles, small appliances and kitchen tools FUNCTIONAL & VERSATILE: These versatile bins can also be used in other rooms of the home - use them in craft rooms, laundry/utility rooms, bedrooms, bathrooms, offices, garages, toy rooms, and playrooms; mDESIGN TIP: Create a storage spot in the mudroom or entryway for outdoor accessories like baseball hats, caps, gloves and scarves; Versatile, lightweight and easy to transport, these are great in apartments, condos, dorm rooms, RVs and campers QUALITY CONSTRUCTION: Made of strong steel wire with a durable rust-resistant finish; Easy Care - Wipe clean with a damp cloth THOUGHTFULLY SIZED: Each measure 8.12\" x 14.1\" x 6.57\" high","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HhOfYcwjL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"mDesign","source_asin":"B082P7QTNP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-452824","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082P7QTNP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082P7QTNP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":452825,"name":"Thick Sink Racks, Telescopic Drain Racks, Kitchen Supplies, Multifunctional Pull-Out Storage Racks, Hanging Dishwashing Rag Racks (Color : Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ZDWIkbFNL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"The hollow design can drain water, and the hollow design at the bottom prevents water accumulation and is convenient for draining.The hanging rod + double-layer chassis is more convenient, the hanging rod can store rags and towels, the drain tray can store hand soap/steel balls, etc., and the hanging rod can be detached.Thicker PP material, good bearing capacity, will not be deformed, wear-resistant and durable, and can store more products at a time.The free telescopic sink is universal, with a telescopic design, flexible use, and can be placed on sinks of various sizes.The assembly type is flexible to use, with 1 base drain layer + 2 brackets.Name: Multifunctional stretchable drain rackFeatures: movable stretch and easy to usecolor: Blue , Gray , Pink , WhiteMaterial: PP plasticUse range: kitchen sinkSize: 360-490*90mmPackage Contents:1*Storage rackWarm Prompt:Only the above package contents, not including other products.Note: Light shooting and different monitors may cause the color of the objects in the picture to be slightly different from the actual object. The allowable measurement error is +/- 1-3cm.The non-slip suction cup can suck the table tightly, and the fixed shelf will not move.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ZDWIkbFNL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Thick","source_asin":"B0B6H9DQL7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-452825","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6H9DQL7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6H9DQL7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":452826,"name":"Perfectly Ordinary Dark Wood Oval Platter for Charcuterie, Meat, Cheese and Fruit Presentation, Acacia, Kitchen, Parties, Wine and Cheese, Snack, Holi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gR3FZXXxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A perfect ordinary serving platter for any occasion, including spring gatherings outdoors and in. This 100% original acacia wood is a beautiful rustic dark carbonized color, highlighting the unique aspects of the wood’s grain, while presenting a professional oval shape often found at wineries around the world and complementing the array of charcuterie and other goodies you’ll be serving. As a harder, denser wood rich with natural oils, Acacia wood is free from harmful chemicals, glues, sealants, plastics, perfect as a presentation and cutting board for all foods. Unlike bamboo, Acacia is a genuine hard wood rich with natural oils that gives it a natural water resistance.  USING YOUR BOARD: Serve a variety of your favorite combinations, from cheese and meat boards, to vegetable and fruit combinations with delicious dips, to a spread of favorite meats, cheeses, fruits, pate’s, dips, hummus, nuts and veggies to delight the palate, and the eye. Don’t forget to pair with a seasonal bottle of wine. Serve outdoors, gather around the kitchen island, or place as a centerpiece of the dining table and watch your guests oogle over its delicious contents.CARE OF YOUR BOARD: Please note our products are free of chemical stains but have achieved the darkened color with the process of carbonization which heats and also sterilizes the boards. When you first receive your board, clean with warm soapy water, dry (it is normal to see a darkening of the cloth on first wash) and coat your board with coconut or butcher's block oil.. Allow to sit at least one hour prior to use. Wash with warm soapy water after each use, and periodically coat with oil to maintain the wood’s natural qualities. Do not soak or submerge board in water. Odors can be removed from wood boards by rubbing the board with kosher or table salt and half a lemon. Size: 20\" x 9.25\" x 1/2\" Please feel free to email us with any concerns or questions regarding your new board!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gR3FZXXxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chiscott","source_asin":"B07JJMNF8M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-452826","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JJMNF8M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JJMNF8M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
