window.products.push({"id":452835,"name":"Love You to The Moon and Back Rustic Barn Wood Pallet Sign 14\"x24\" Handcrafted Antique Style Inspirational Wall Decor Fun Design in Teal with Black Qu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zIdEJk3YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add a lovely, cute rustic touch to your childs room with this primitive wood pallet sign by Fireside Home In-A-Word range. Hand crafted with pride from real distressed planked wood and solid wood frame. This beautiful barnwood sign has a rustic and weathered patina for a perfect vintage shabby chic appearance. This natural aged textural pallet sign features a fun design of the moon and stars in teal (green blue) with the positive \"Love you to the moon and back\" message in black. It serves as a great way to remind your child and family how much you love them. Great as a baby shower or housewarming gift. This artistic vintage look piece that will be beautiful in your home. This old style art poster makes for a distinctive home decor item; you can use it to decorate areas such as your loft, foyer, office, dining room, bedroom, nursery or living area. We hand-make our signs and stain the aged wood so that the natural beauty of the real wood is accentuated. The care and maintenance required for this authentic plaque is easy; just a gentle wipe with a damp cloth will suffice. HASSLE FREE RETURN POLICY. This is a very high quality product designed to motivate and inspire. We hope you'll love it as much as we love making it. Product Specifications: Length: 14 inches, Depth / thickness: 2 inches, Height: 24 inches What Sets Our Signs Apart - Well first of we design and make all our signs ourselves by hand. There are lots of other suppliers that claim that but the reality is very different as most are mass produced and made from inferior materials. We love our signs from concept to completion and we know you will too. Great Design - we go far beyond just throwing a cool quote on a sign, our signs have original design and THAT sets us apart from the ordinary. Go on, you deserve the best, this sign is going to look fantastic in your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zIdEJk3YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"In A Word","source_asin":"B06XKR1NPB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-452835","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XKR1NPB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XKR1NPB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
