window.products.push({"id":452868,"name":"puredown® Down Comforter Full/Queen Size, Medium Warmth Duvet Insert, Hotel Collection Comforter Duvet, Ultra-Soft Shell Fluffy Bedding Comforters for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vQB+sOHaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【Ultra-Soft Fabric】- The shell is made from silky microfiber fabric, down proof, wrinkle-resistant, and feels incredibly soft and smooth while staying breathable, noiseless when flipping, you can feel like sleeping on the clouds. It is skin-friendly, sensitive skin people can also use it with confidence. ✅【Premium Filling】- Our down comforter is filled with the high down content blend –75% white down and 25% feather, which are responsibly harvested and RDS, OEKO-Tex Standard 100 certified. Down has better insulation than other types of fillings. It can keep you warm, the higher the down percentage, the warmer it will be. ✅【All Season Comforter】- Lightweight to sleep under and keeps you warm without adding extra weight and bulk. No matter hot or cold, the quilted bed comforter can offer medium warmth and perfect for most people's year-round use.4 choices are available - Twin Size: 68*90”, 28.5 oz fill weight; - Full/Queen Size: 90*90”, 37.8 oz fill weight; - King Size: 106*90”,44.5 oz fill weight; - Oversized King Size: 116*98”, 53 oz fill weight ✅【Unique Design】- 3D Baffle Box Construction is designed for maximum loft, warmth, and durability. The baffle boxe keeps the inner filling evenly distributed and trap more air, preventing heat loss, ensuring you a stable and long-lasting comfortable sleep. Corner Tabs are very convenient for attaching and anchoring a duvet cover, protecting the comforter from shifting. Superior double needle stitch and elegant white piping prevent leakage and give a fashionable look. ✅【Care Instruction】- Dry Cleaning. Clean your comforter as infrequently as possible, as this can also damage the down filling. Spot cleaning stains is also a great way to extend the time between washings. Since the down comforter is vacuum packed, it is recommended to spread it for a few hours and pat or shake gently by holding each end to keep the filling evenly distributed. This increases airflow and helps stop the clumping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vQB+sOHaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"puredown","source_asin":"B0BNPG9TSY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-452868","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNPG9TSY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNPG9TSY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
