window.products.push({"id":452881,"name":"Sharry HOME LINEN Down Alternative King Comforter Set - Duvet Insert with Tabs -All Season-Ultra Soft(Light Blue, King)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mYupD59zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Linen,brushed Microfiber Easily Convert : Our 100% Double Brushed Microfiber 3PC Comforter King set includes 1 King/California King down alternative comforter102” X 90” and 2 pillow sham 20” X 36” . With four corner taps and four loops located at middle of each edge, the comforter can either be separately used or putted into any corresponded size duvet cover. No fuss of shifting in duvet covers at all. Ultra Soft: We are so proud of our down alternative comforter covering 110GSM Microfiber fabric processed with double peachy skin brushing and filling with 94 OZ 3D silky fiber bring amazing soft into your bed to indulge yourself in sweet dream Just as in cloud.Because of vacuum sealing, at the moment of opening the package may not be as fluffy as your expectation. Please expose it to sunlight , the 3D hollow fiber will fluffy up after couple of hours. All season& Warmth: 3 dimensional fiber filling in our comforter truly brings soft and fluffy to your whole night sleeping. Even though after years pressure in wardrobe the comforter will be as fluffy as brand new’s. More than that, the hollow structure will easier absorb and maintain heat to keep you warm in the chilly nights rather than filling so much solid fiber that suffering too much weight. Excellent Craftsmanship&Durable: Classic Box pattern stitching matching with vibrant colors are not only perpetually sophisticated way to enhance aesthetic taste for bed room but also one way firmly prevent silky filling shifting and clumping. Elaborately sewed piping edge with double stitching is a perfect combination of elegance and durability . Wonderful Service: We are committed to bringing a cheerful and satisfying shopping experience for our customers and we are confident of you loving the comforter . For whatsoever reason, If you are not happy with our comforter please send email to let us know and we will fix the issue right away or just simply return it to get a full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mYupD59zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sharry HOME LINEN","source_asin":"B081K2HF79","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-452881","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081K2HF79","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081K2HF79","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
